summon item 18 72 29 {Tags:["ff_task_book_temp"],PickupDelay:32767,Age:-32768,Item:{id:"minecraft:written_book",count:1,components:{written_book_content:{title:"ᴘᴛᴇʀᴀᴅᴀᴄᴛʏʟ ᴄʟᴏɴᴇ",author:"ғᴏssɪʟ ғʀɪɢʜᴛs",pages:[[{"text":"ᴘᴛᴇʀᴀᴅᴀᴄᴛʏʟ ᴄʟᴏɴᴇ\n"},{"text":"-------------------\n"},{"text":"ᴜɴᴋɴᴏᴡɴ ● "},{"text":"ɪɴꜱᴀɴᴇ\n","color":"red"},{"text":"\nWow. So you really made it 10 days. Most people quit after 2. Well, technically I fire them. Anyway.....\n\n(Multiple Pages)\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"I think I can trust you with this. I left the secret laboratory doors open. It’s between the rings of Earth.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"I’m going to need you to clone a dino for me. I’m out of microfiber cloths, so you’ll have to flatten a sponge with the anvil, then use that to scrub the pteradactyl egg for DNA. \n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"Now put that DNA cloth in the DNA analyzer, it's that machine with the big empty tank. If it works it will start running and you'll see a dino in the cloning vat.\n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"Next the check the screen of the Clonomat and it will specify an item it needs, go grab it, and toss into the centrifuge, if the items correct it will start spinning.\n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"And uhm, yeah. That's it... If you get this done I'll hire you full-time and start paying you even. \n\nOh! I almost forgot, the clonomat produces a plushie as a byproduct, feel free to keep it, I've got hundreds already."}]]},custom_name:{"text":"ᴘᴛᴇʀᴀᴅᴀᴄᴛʏʟ ᴄʟᴏɴᴇ","color":"red","italic":false},lore:[{"text":"","extra":["task_final"]}],enchantment_glint_override:false,tooltip_display:{hidden_components:["lore","written_book_content"]},max_stack_size:99,custom_data:{ff_task_book:"pteradactyl_clone"}}}}
